<title>BELGIUM: Virgin Express says to raise bid for Air Liberte.</title>
<headline>Virgin Express says to raise bid for Air Liberte.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Richard Branson's Virgin Express regional airline will raise its planned bid for ailing French carrier  Air Liberte to challenge an offer by rival British Airways Plc (BA), Virgin Express's chief executive officer Jonathan Ornstein said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
